<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-TOM STEELS WINS FINAL STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOM STEELS WINS FINAL STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tom Steels of Belgium won the 22nd and final stage of the Tour of Spain over 165 kms, starting and finishing in Madrid on Sunday.</p>
<p>Alex Zuelle won the overall Tour.</p>
</text>
